# The source of cortex's block in the repository's CODEOWNERS (spec D8).
# cortex/bin/adapt.sh writes these patterns, then one per TEST_GLOBS entry,
# each owned by CODE_OWNERS from cortex/config; lines starting with # here are
# not copied. Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for the default
# branch; without it the block only suggests reviewers. In CODEOWNERS the last
# matching line wins, so for these paths the block replaces the project's own
# owners: list them in CODE_OWNERS too if they must keep approving.
#
# Test locks: an agent may add tests through test-first, but a person
# approves what they assert.
/cortex/changes/**/lock.md    @OWNER
# The harness, its configuration and the gates that enforce it.
/cortex/bin/                  @OWNER
/cortex/config                @OWNER
/cortex/harness/              @OWNER
/cortex/constitution.md       @OWNER
/cortex/AGENTS.md             @OWNER
/AGENTS.md                    @OWNER
# CI, including the file that holds this block.
/.github/workflows/cortex.yml @OWNER
/.github/CODEOWNERS           @OWNER
